c-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-39_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-c0b6beb0-b37b-44f4-b89c-8b6345e8df83"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">My testosterone barely moved.Then I discovered the real problem wasn’t the ingredients—it was HOW I was taking them.<br><br>If you’re a man in your 30s or 40s taking testosterone supplements (Tongkat Ali, Ashwagandha, Fenugree, shilajit etc..) and still feeling:</span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:12px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-40_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-41_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-42_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Exhausted by 2pm (needing multiple coffees just to function)</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-43_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-44_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Soft around the midsection (despite lifting 4x/week)</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-45_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-46_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Low drive and motivation (nothing like you felt at 25)</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-47_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-3e28e533-65d1-4405-8a44-de91ea0dc4df"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Keep reading. This might be the most important thing you read all year.</span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-48_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-df574ac0-8fac-4f9e-b308-97173de057c7"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">By <strong><em>Robert</em>,</strong>&nbsp;Founder of Alpha Brew</span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-49_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-7f7b47ed-4ed2-4f8d-a703-de3066b7bf91"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Former supplement junkie who wasted 3 years and $12k before figuring this out</span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-50_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-cd8d496b-f3c1-4d7d-b425-aaa7dbdffea7"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>The $12,000 Experiment</strong></span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-51_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-f2c6946a-a1f8-497f-b1b0-78362f90bde0"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Over the last&nbsp;3 years, I tried everything:</span></p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-52_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-53_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-54_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-73fa075d-7acd-4ad4-a267-76e2312fa63b"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Year 1: The “Beginner Stack”</strong></span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-55_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-56_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-57_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Tongkat Ali - $45/month</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-58_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-59_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Ashwagandha - $30/month&nbsp;</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-60_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-61_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Vitamin D + Zinc - $25/month&nbsp;</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-62_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-63_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Total: $100/month = $1,200/year</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-64_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-1c7a1dce-f3f3-478a-b603-aad2d4b2a384"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Result:</strong> </span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-65_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-b3401c7a-1dce-43f3-b78a-3603aad2d4b2"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Felt… maybe 5% better? Hard to tell if it was placebo.</span></p></div><div data-element-placeholder="true" style="position:relative" data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-66_ pf-hide"></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-67_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-68_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-69_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-bca81567-c7e2-4079-b691-8b8c60ec4943"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Year 2: The “Aggressive Stack”</strong></span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-70_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-71_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-72_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Added: Cordyceps, Shilajit, Fenugreek, Boron, Magnesium</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-73_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-74_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Total: $180/month = $2,160/year</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-75_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-8b8c60ec-4943-466e-8cec-aa146ceac4d9"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Result:</strong> </span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-76_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-8c60ec49-4326-4e8c-acaa-146ceac4d944"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Still tired by 2pm. Still soft around the middle. Still frustrated.</span></p></div><div data-element-placeholder="true" style="position:relative" data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-77_ pf-hide"></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-78_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-79_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-80_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-c8b1e30a-0fcd-43c3-9488-ad3a7ddb7905"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Year 3: The “Premium Everything” Phase</strong></span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-81_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-82_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-83_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Upgraded to “pharmaceutical grade” versions</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-84_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-85_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Added pre-workout, post-workout, sleep supplements&nbsp;</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-86_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-87_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Total: $250+/month = $3,000+/year</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-88_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-ad3a7ddb-7905-4ccb-9dd5-d3150484fadc"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Result:</strong> </span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-89_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-3a7ddb79-051c-4b9d-95d3-150484fadca9"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Barely any difference from Year 1.</span></p></div><div data-element-placeholder="true" style="position:relative" data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-90_ pf-hide"></div></div><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-91_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-3193b039-999a-4d72-855d-8da07a9b5b60"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>Total spent over 3 years: <br></strong><br>$6,360 on supplements(Plus another $5,000+ on gym memberships, personal trainers, blood work, doctor consultations…)<br><br>And I still felt like shit.</span></p><img alt="1.png__PID:45e2c974-e27b-423b-95e3-32ab89c8286d" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/1_114bef0d-3055-44be-abdf-3e9a3c888012.png?v=1766534785&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.833810888252149" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-fscnvs dncZrx pf-92_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-93_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-ddd09094-2279-4cbc-9c70-e36aa1742e01"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">My bathroom cabinet in 2023. $180/month in pills I wasn’t even absorbing.”
</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cyRdfs qmQNK pf-94_ pf-heading-1-h3"><strong>The Morning Coffee Realization</strong></h3><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-96_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-867193cd-6a03-4683-b4fa-382b324718b4"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Every morning, like clockwork, I did the same thing.<br><br>7:00am.<br>Coffee in one hand.<br>Six testosterone capsules in the other.<br><br>I swallowed them right after my first sip—thinking I was doing everything right.<br><br>Then one morning, while scrolling through research, I found a study that stopped me cold.</span></p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-97_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-98_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-801a7018-71e9-409e-88d6-afcebb2aedf9"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>“Caffeine-Induced Cortisol Response and Testosterone Suppression in Male Subjects”<br></strong><br><em>Journal of Clinical Endocrinology, 2024</em></span></p></div><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-99_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-e166cec7-c7e8-433d-82e8-5999f3f90f72"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">I started reading.<br><br>Then I read it again.<br><br>And again.<br><br>The study showed something I wasn’t prepared for:<br><br><strong>Men who drank 2+ cups of coffee daily for 90+ days had 14% LOWER baseline testosterone </strong>than men who didn’t drink coffee.<strong><br></strong><br>Wait… what?<br><br>My morning coffee—the thing I relied on to feel sharp and energized—was actively <strong>suppressing my testosterone</strong>.<br><br>Every.<br>Single.<br>Morning.<br><br>And here’s the part that hit me hardest:<br><br>I was drinking coffee…<br><strong>then taking testosterone pills 15 minutes later…<br></strong>trying to boost what the coffee had just shut down.<br><br>I wasn’t helping myself.<br><br>I was fighting myself.</span></p><img alt="Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png__PID:2f19403d-8a26-48b7-86d8-d6b1aaaeeb66" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_af97ilaf97ilaf97.png?v=1766750489&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.872340425531915" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-fscnvs dncZrx pf-100_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"/><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-101_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-d29b63b8-c9fe-4fda-9781-110b6facd5ad"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>“But It Gets Worse…”</strong></span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-102_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-9ef14e3e-9ad8-4058-b9ac-e6f34c178dac"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Once I realized that, I started digging deeper.<br><br>And what I found made everything click.<br><br>It turned out coffee wasn’t the only reason my pills weren’t working.<br><br>There were four major problems stacked against me.</span></p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-103_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-104_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-105_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-106_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-107_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-a0ec01d2-1f5f-4df9-83da-907098d73eb0"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Problem #1:<br></span></p></div><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-108_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-9681344c-5477-4dff-8422-90fdacac7d5d"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>I Was Only Absorbing 15–20% of My Pills</strong></span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-109_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-da907098-d73e-40cd-a746-ef8619285621"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Most testosterone supplements are fat-soluble.<br><br>I was taking them with water…<br>or worse—coffee, which is basically 98% water.<br><br>That’s a disaster for absorption.<br><br>The research was brutal:</span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-110_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-111_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-112_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Capsules taken with water: 12–18% bioavailability</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-113_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-114_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Hot-water extraction (used in traditional medicine): 64–71% bioavailability</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-115_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-b53b63dc-8424-4382-88cd-4a14e809023e"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Meaning?<br><br>I was wasting up to 80% of what I was paying for.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-116_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-117_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-118_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-119_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-1220e705-036b-4b0b-8a88-343f9d872fec"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Problem #2:<br></span></p></div><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-120_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-28562118-9205-4c4a-b62d-a3fa22c193d5"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>I Was Taking Them at the Worst Possible Time</strong></span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-121_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-2da3fa22-c193-4584-aeb8-f31a9578c00b"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Testosterone follows a circadian rhythm.</span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-122_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-123_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-124_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>6–9am: Peak production (100%)</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-125_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-126_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Mid-day: ~60%</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-127_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-128_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Evening: ~30%</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-129_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-63aeba48-c90f-468c-be22-e03de1658ed0"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">And when was I taking my pills?<br><br>Lunch.<br><br>After work.<br><br>Whenever I remembered.<br><br>I was trying to boost testosterone right when my body was naturally shutting it down.<br><br>No wonder nothing changed.</span></p></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-130_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-131_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-132_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-133_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-134_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-1211cc85-a40c-4b02-bccd-34d71e00af4e"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Problem #3:<br></span></p></div><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-135_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-11cc85a4-0c8b-42fc-8d34-d71e00af4eba"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>My Coffee Was Actively Undermining My Results</strong></span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-136_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-cc85a40c-8b02-4ccd-b4d7-1e00af4eba20"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">It wasn’t just about cortisol once.<br><br>I had created a full-blown hormonal rollercoaster:</span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-137_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-138_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-139_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg><strong>7:00am:</strong> Coffee → cortisol spikes → testosterone drops</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-140_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-141_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg><strong>7:15am:</strong> Pills → trying to force T back up</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-142_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-143_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg><strong>10:00am:</strong> Second coffee → cortisol spikes again</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-144_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-145_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg><strong>2:00pm:</strong> Third coffee → more hormonal damage</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-146_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-147_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg><strong>6:00pm:</strong> Pills wear off… cortisol still elevated</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-148_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-fccd34d7-1e00-4f4e-ba20-d63a98e83200"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">I wasn’t optimizing hormones.<br><br>I was living in constant hormonal chaos.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-149_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-150_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-fYXHKj TqaeK pf-151_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-152_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-1e00af4e-ba20-463a-98e8-3200bd7927ff"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Problem #4:<br></span></p></div><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-153_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-00af4eba-20d6-4a98-a832-00bd7927ff77"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><strong>I Was Taking 6 Separate Pills That Were Never Meant to Work Together</strong></span></p><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-154_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-af4eba20-d63a-48e8-b200-bd7927ff77fa"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">This one shocked me the most.<br><br>Certain testosterone ingredients only work when taken together.<br><br>For example:</span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-155_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-156_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-157_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg><strong>Shilajit </strong>opens an “absorption window” for <strong>45–75 minutes</strong></li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-158_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-159_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Take <strong>Tongkat Ali</strong> before that window opens?→ You lose <strong>30–40%</strong> of its effect</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-160_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-161_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg><strong>L-Theanine</strong> must be pre-combined with caffeine to blunt cortisol spikes</li></ul><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-162_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-3200bd79-27ff-47fa-9825-b62d03d9461b"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Taking pills 10–30 minutes apart?<br><br>That destroys synergy.</span></p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-eONOlN dawdJE pf-163_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-164_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-165_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"></path></svg>Sequential intake: ~60% of potential benefit</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bStdFM fgfEIw pf-166_ pf-text-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" data-pf-type="Icon2" class="sc-bhqpXc gsacjk pf-167_ pf-icon2-1"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9